|------------|----------|----------------------|------------------|
| Kagoshima City Museum of Art | 1.2 km | 15 min | Walk |
| Kagoshima Castle | 1 km | 12 min | Walk |
| Sengan‑en Garden | 1.5 km | 18 min | Walk |
| Sakurajima Observation Deck | 2 km | 25 min | Bus (Route 1) |
| Kagoshima Aquarium | 2.5 km | 30 min | Bus (Route 2) |
| Shiroyama Park | 1 km | 12 min | Walk |

All attractions are within a 30‑minute walk or a short bus ride from HOTEL NOIR Kagoshima Chuo Station, making them convenient for a day of exploration. Enjoy your stay in Kagoshima!

